// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Carter Mordesen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3160176246" "Carter Mordesen"
// ProfessionString :
"P2254900965" "Anchorite of the Carnival of War"
// DescriptionString :
"P1592029644" "Carter Mordesen is one of the talented mystics who found their way to the Carnival of Light after the collapse of the Praetorian Midnight Squad. In the time since the fall of First Ward, he has grown increasingly impatient with Vanessa DeVore and the rest of the Carnival of Light's leadership. This growing impatience made him a prime target for recruitment into the Carnival of War when the schism occurred with the Carnival of Light. He has come to Cap au Diable in an effort to recruit assistance in bringing an end to the many crises facing First Ward."
// LocationString :
"P3766049399" "Cap au Diable"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2116187179" "I cannot reveal my secrets to you at this time.<br><br><color orange>You must become a VIP or purchase the First Ward from the Paragon Market in order to access this contact."
// HelloString :
"P1183881361" "The winds of war bring us together again."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P144052205" "You are too weak to assist me at this time."
// FirstVisitString :
"P552470327" "{HeroName}. I am known as Carter Mordesen. I am an Anchorite within the Carnival. We have need of someone with your <i>expertise</i> to put an end to a great many troubles for us. We need your help against a great enemy that stirs, and if it is not stopped, then it will consume us all.<br><br>You will, of course, be well compensated for your efforts."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P869800561" "Let's be honest, {HeroName}. You have bigger plans that shouldn't be set aside to help the poor little people of Praetoria's First Ward. Leave this job to those who would serve better as your minions."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2427370819" "You think you can do anything, but everyone has limits. Take care of your current affairs and then we can talk. Until then, I'm afraid that I cannot rely upon you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3200084457" "Your strength is found lacking. See me again when you are, as the Arachnos officials would call you, threat level 20."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1817356344" "You are more complex than I originally guessed, {HeroName}, I can see us cultivating a mutually beneficial relationship here."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2494185263" "The Carnival trusts my word, {HeroName}, and I told them I trust you. In time they too will see that for themselves."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2472804946" "How is it that you can see my FailsafeLevelString?  That should be impossible, unless we've raised the level cap or you're peeking through .pigg files."
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
