// ProfessionString :
"P3545744020" "Goldbricker Spokesperson"
// DescriptionString :
"P1831864983" "Mr. Rodney is a 'veteran' Goldbricker who has been promoted to the role of a spokesperson for King Midas.<br><br>Whenever Midas wishes to bargain a deal with a villain or organization, he will send one of his spokespersons to do so for him."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1106710420" "We're here to work together, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P1399995359" "King Midas sends his regards."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3692081271" "Sorry, but King Midas doesn't have you on his radar."
// FirstVisitString :
"P289050841" "Hey there, {HeroName}. Happy to be talking to you at the moment, especially sans any <i>beatings</i>.<br><br>The name is Mr. Rodney, and I'm a representative of King Midas, head of the Goldbrickers.<br><br>Now, I know perhaps you and our fine organization haven't gotten along in the past, but, well, let's just consider the past the past, right?<br><br>King Midas wishes to extend a gesture of good will towards you in the form of me helping you get what you need. And I think I've got an idea of what we can do to help you out, so why don't we get started?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P291700067" "That's everything I have for you now, {HeroName}. If King Midas or myself can think of something else, we'll contact you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2146228606" "Looks like you've got your hands full at the moment, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3117304156" "I've got an idea of what we can do to help you out next, {HeroName}, but you'll only be able to handle it when you've reached threat level 30."
